            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Acceptance</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Making room for difficult emotions rather than suppressing them returns the energy the struggle consumes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">Cognitive Defusion</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Learning to see a thought as something the mind produces rather than as absolute truth.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-warm rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-tertiary">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-2">The Present Moment</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">Mindfulness practice brings attention back from the pull of past and future to the here and now.</p>
          </div>
